#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function returns 365 for a normal year and 366 for a leap year.  The "
"calculation for leap year is based on:"
msgstr ""
"La fonction renvoie 365 pour une année normale et 366 pour une année "
"bissextile. L'identification d'une année bissextile repose sur le calcul "
"suivant\\ :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "(year) %4 == 0 && ((year) %100 != 0 || (year) %400 == 0)\n"
msgstr "(year) %4 == 0 && ((year) %100 != 0 || (year) %400 == 0)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The formula is defined in the macro I<__isleap(year)> also found in "
"I<E<lt>time.hE<gt>>."
msgstr ""
"La formule est définie dans la macro I<__isleap(year)> que l'on trouve "
"également dans I<E<lt>time.hE<gt>>."

